Error [jet.MarkedFunctionValue]: `edit` can't be used as a function value because its parameter `value` is `&`
  --> tests/ui/function_value_access_cannot_erase.jet:10:22
    |
 10 |     edit_callback :: edit
    |                      ^^^^
 Why: A function type gives each parameter plain read access, so a value of `edit` would drop the `&` its callers must write
 Fix: Call `edit` directly with the `&` mark, or pass a lambda that makes that call
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0227

Error [jet.MarkedFunctionValue]: `consume` can't be used as a function value because its parameter `value` is `^`
